    },
    {
      "name": "Swarming Bites",
      "actions": 1,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>Each enemy in the spider swarm's space takes <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">1d4-1</span> piercing damage with a DC 13 basic Reflex save. A creature that fails its save is exposed to spider swarm venom.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
    }
  ],
  "spellcastingEntries": [],
  "description": "<p>An abundance of food, the sudden hatching of a clutch of eggs, or magical influence can cause smaller spiders to gather in terrifying, deadly masses.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Few everyday vermin inspire as much dread as the infamous spider.</p>",
